[{"id":168975814,"discussion_id":"a5ced4a9f62255aa2d5c19b682b064a9aa714562","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| rnn | ✅ [*gcw_kUomxQ2l*](https://gitcode.com/gcw_kUomxQ2l), [*陈琦*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317) (2/2) | ✅ [*gcw_kUomxQ2l*](https://gitcode.com/gcw_kUomxQ2l) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n chenyanbin8, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-04-21T15:41:35+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-21T19:36:28+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168975821,"discussion_id":"b8ad76bc73393e4aa44ca6a186a90fbfb8e6d99e","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-04-21T15:41:36+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-21T15:41:36+08:00","user":{"id":"68849220bac92f260ce33966","login":"chenyanbin8","object_id":"68849220bac92f260ce33966","name":"chenyanbin8","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/chenyanbin8"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168975925,"discussion_id":"e3960f138b01bd5d86a130d3c5d06e1627d72f32","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复单层LSTM梯度算子内核中一个数据类型相关的计算错误。原代码在处理序列长度掩码时，错误地使用固定的`FLOAT_BYTES`常量来计算内存步长，导致当模板数据类型`T`为`half`或`bfloat16`等非`float`类型时，内存访问偏移计算错误，可能引发数据读写错误或性能问题。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n将`ProcessDhSequenceLengthMask`函数中`dataCopyInSeqParams`参数的`srcStride`（源数据步长）计算，从硬编码的`FLOAT_BYTES`改为使用与模板类型`T`大小一致的`sizeof(T)`。此修改确保了在不同数据类型下内存拷贝步长计算的正确性，提升了代码的通用性和健壮性。","created_at":"2026-04-21T15:42:10+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-21T15:42:10+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168976028,"discussion_id":"8cfb3905c5c56c920be457c0e8264e1dab225b14","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=a59f9587f5e54e438b19e63e4f5546e4&pipelineRunId=fd06849c08b44a90b4f3b92ba113fdf4&projectName=CANN'>fd06849c08b44a90b4f3b92ba113fdf4</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Compile_Ascend_X86_mobile_station</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=a59f9587f5e54e438b19e63e4f5546e4&pipelineRunId=fd06849c08b44a90b4f3b92ba113fdf4&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-nn/package/4050/cann-ops-nn-kirinx90_linux-x86_64.run>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                 